	(text "Q1 drop-in alternates (PG-TDSON-8, S1-3 G4 D5-8, ≤ 3.3 m):\nSOA @ 21 V, 0.4 ms worst-case trip (need 4.8 A, 6.2 A w/ margin), ΔT at 20 A:\n  BSC028N06NS   2.8 mO, 60 V ~8 A, ΔT +87 K (~45k in stock as of 10/27)\n  BSC016N06NSATMA1 1.6mO, 60V, 10A, ΔT +41 K (~24k in stock as of 10/27)\n  BSC018N04LSGATMA1 1.8mO, 40V, >>10A, ΔT +44 K\n  \n    "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.426 155.448 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "085ffa73-7add-4cb8-b4e9-90ec25c3c6e5")
	)
	(text "V_DS 60 V\nR_DS(on) 1.45 mΩ\nI_D 257 A (at 25C)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 128.27 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3c6bafc5-19d7-4cb9-b7f0-221534697a6c")
	)
	(text "Fault timer (C78):\nt = C x 4 V / I_TIMER\n= 680p x 4 V / 25 uA\n≈ 0.11 ms typ (0.08-0.18 ms, I_TIMER 15-34 uA)\n(while in current or power limit)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 136.652 135.128 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "42b2d0fb-8419-42d8-8c67-1e6cf6d81014")
	)
	(text "Figuring out max Rds (on)\nAssuming a max temperature change of (max - ambient) = ~140 - 40 = 100K\nfor BSC018N04LSG, junction to ambient thermal resistance is 50K/W\nFor 100k temp rise, looking at 2W power dissipation\nP = I^2 * R -> R(hot) = P/I^2\nR (hot) = 2W/400 = 5m\nRds(on) * ~1.5 = R(hot)\nRds(on) = 5/1.5 = ~3.33m\n\nin general, for PTC MOSFETS:\nRds(hot) = (T_max - T_ambient)/(R_thja * I^2)\nRds(on) = R(hot) / ~1.5\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 27.432 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "67b40f39-396b-4b2b-a7b8-d1e238e01b4d")
	)
	(text "VBATT Master Switch\n"
